## Summary

**The architecture is now 9/10.** Centralized theme, type-safe animations, reduced-motion support, proper SEO, curated information architecture — the skeleton is genuinely strong.

**The content is 5.5/10.** Generic bio, missing descriptions, empty verify URLs, hobby-skills, AI whispers, no photo. This is the ONLY thing holding the site back.

**The uncomfortable truth:** A world-class site with placeholder content is still a placeholder site. The code can't carry the weight alone — the words and images need to match the architecture's quality. Your next session should be 100% content, 0% code.
